DESCRIPTION:Friday\, April 3\, 2026\nhttps://activities.outdoors.org/s/oc-
 activity/a5UVX0000014Btx2AE/\nJoin the Worcester Chapter 20s & 30s for the
  first full moon hike of the 2026 season! We will travel 2-3 miles over ea
 sy to moderate terrain along Asnebumskit Hill in Paxton\, MA. The pace wil
 l be easy to moderate. Expect to be on trail for a few hours. Enjoy views 
 of the surrounding hills as we wind through forest lined with stone walls 
 and dotted with brooks. Elevation gain is under 500 feet.Enjoy a Friday ni
 ght with outdoor friends new and old.And... TRAIL CULT PRESENTS!!!An on-tr
 ail Cryptid history lesson! Coming to you live\, the story of the Man\, th
 e Moth\, the Legend... MOTHMAN!!!Just what happened in Point Pleasant\, We
 st Virginia in 1967? What does Dustin Hoffman have to do with it? And how 
 does a 7-foot tall\, anthropomorphized\, bug man become a gay icon? All th
 at and more!!!
